ontent":"木贼草、问荆草、节节草对比"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-9u55cvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-9u55cvc","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木贼草、问荆草、节节草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木贼草、问荆草、节节草-20240714161249-jovvokk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-kb7s844","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-kb7s844","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（左为木贼、中为问荆草、右为节节草）"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-lt8fyk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-lt8fyk9","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240714172903-02t1crj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-a9hadxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-a9hadxd","updated":"20240715081110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：木贼、问荆草、节节草三者较为相像。点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240206105320-uy3iyuc","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"木贼"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240714160812-w1wp2jx","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"节节草"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-ucg2xdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-ucg2xdy","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"木贼茎节是三者之中最粗的，独立而没有分叉，偶尔出现三分之一的细分枝；木贼植株能长得很高，能达到一米甚至三米以上，又有记载戏称它为通天草；"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-8lkolt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-8lkolt8","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"节节草的茎比木贼明显细，结突出分支明显比木贼多，丛生密集，高可达一米，一年生（有的人小时候会把它的节打开，加在眉毛头发上玩）；"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-xti4dik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-xti4dik","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"问荆草植株成熟后分枝开始环生，非常密集，植株高度在30-50厘米，常生长在田边（传说它是吸收土壤里的金元素生长的，所以有它的地方就有金子）；"}]},{"ID":"20240714173447-b35yyod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714173447-b35yyod","updated":"20240714173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三者无花无叶无果，都是靠顶部孢子结构繁殖；问荆草茎杆实心，其他两者是空心的；"}]},{"ID":"20240714164924-xvrf7su","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240714164924-xvrf7su"}},{"ID":"20240714165556-7aguq2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714165556-7aguq2i","updated":"20240903083124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"问荆"}]},{"ID":"20240903083126-asb473j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083126-asb473j","updated":"20240903083206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味：味甘、苦，性平。"}]},{"ID":"20240903083136-i7majqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083136-i7majqy","updated":"20240903083209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经：入肺、胃、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240903083138-504a11a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083138-504a11a","updated":"20240903083212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功效：止血，利尿，明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240903083141-i3mhshq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083141-i3mhshq","updated":"20240903083216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：鼻衄，吐血，咯血，便血，崩漏，外伤出血，淋证，目赤翳膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240903083142-1ch3wtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083142-1ch3wtf","updated":"20240903083147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相关配伍："}]},{"ID":"20240903083226-rkazq1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083226-rkazq1l","updated":"20240903083228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、治鼻衄，问荆30g，旱莲草30g。水煎服。（《四川中药志》1982年）\n2、治崩漏，问荆30g，马齿苋30g。水煎服。（《四川中药志》1982年）\n3、治热淋，小便不利，问荆12g，大石韦12g，海金砂藤12g。水煎服。（《四川中药志》1982年）\n4、治火眼生翳，问荆、菊花各15g，蝉衣6g，煎服。（《安徽中草药》）\n5、治目赤肿痛，问荆12g，谷精草12g，野菊花12g，车前草12g。水煎服。（《四川中药志》1982年）\n6、治咳嗽气急，问荆6g，地骷髅21g。水煎服。（《中医药实验研究》）\n7、治腰痛，问荆60g，与豆腐同煮，吃豆腐喝汤。（《山西中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903083155-qx3k72q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083155-qx3k72q","updated":"20240903083158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相关论述："}]},{"ID":"20240903083158-o3lmkc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083158-o3lmkc9","updated":"20240903083238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、《本草拾遗》：“主结气瘤痛，上气气急。”\n2、《四川中药志》1960年版：“清热止咳，治吐血、衄血及妇女倒经。”\n3、《中国药用植物图鉴》：“作利尿及止血药，治风湿、淋病、刀伤。”"}]},{"ID":"20240903083119-jymwfpv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903083119-jymwfpv"}},{"ID":"20240903083120-ta45qxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903083120-ta45qxb"}}]}